{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-hyde-walk-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"hyde-walk-residences-imtiaz-developments-al-satwa","about":"Hyde Walk Residence is a 12-storey residential development by Imtiaz, located in the vibrant Jumeirah Garden City area of Al Satwa, just minutes away from DIFC and the city center. Comprising 100 residences, this residential development offers fully furnished and equipped apartments for sale, providing a high standard of living.Hyde Walk Residence offers studios and 1-bedroom apartments, fully furnished and equipped, making it an affordable property in Al Satwa.Hyde Walk Residence's location in Jumeirah Garden City, a residential area being redeveloped by Meraas Holding, is an important factor. The area is being developed as a vertical community offering a balanced lifestyle in close proximity to retail, education, healthcare and entertainment facilities.On-site amenities include ample parking, electric vehicle charging stations, a fully equipped gym and swimming pool, steam and sauna, children's pool and playground, barbecue area, and concierge and valet services.The transportation accessibility of the area is worth noting - Hyde Walk Residence is located north of Sheikh Zayed Road between Diyafa Street and Safa Park.","price":1000000,"title":"Hyde Walk Residences","bitrix":{"id":959,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Hyde Walk Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Hyde Walk Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Imtiaz Developments","project_location":"Al Satwa"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/562/images/2023/11/19/340x252/52Qs6xIee2WcdbSBGKrsrk6vwdVBRTvo1s1BDYLK.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/562/images/2023/11/19/464x312/52Qs6xIee2WcdbSBGKrsrk6vwdVBRTvo1s1BDYLK.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.219883,"lng